      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh. I think that was an inconsistency left over from when I was considering `Connects` properties on all `Interfaces` entries, rather than an optional property to be used when the port relationships aren\u0027t defined by the `Type`.\n\n\nFor the PCA954* parts the upstream port is implied by the device\u0027s address on the parent bus so the `Interfaces` list only needs to describe the mux\u0027s channels. The same applies for USB hubs such as USX2422\n\nDo you have any concerns with that?\n\nI have adjusted both accordingly.",
      "parentUuid": "a5902e9a_087aa644",
